  "body": "Nestled within the coveted embrace of prime Rothesay Bay, this distinguished residence presents a seamless fusion of superior craftsmanship and sophisticated design, meticulously realized across two beautifully detailed levels. \r\n\r\nSituated within the highly regarded Rangitoto College school zone and just a leisurely stroll from the golden sands, the sparkling ocean , vibrant local cafes, and a host of desirable amenities.\r\n\r\nBrand new duplex property with high-end finishes. \r\nKey features:\r\n*Freehold title, no body corporate, no society fee\r\n*Spacious, functional layout - open-plan living\r\n*3 bedrooms(including a master suite) and 1 beautiful and functional study room\r\n* 2 stylish bathrooms and a separate toilet.\r\n*Sunlit Panoramic Balcony\r\n*North-South Open Layout\r\n\r\nPremium inclusions: \r\n*Fisher & Paykel Full Kitchen Suite- oven, cooktop & dishwasher\r\n*Bathrooms with smart toilets and underfloor heating systems \r\n*EV charger-ready garage for future-proof convenience\r\n*Belgian Quick Step Flooring with warranty - style and peace of mind combined\r\n*NZ-Made Godfrey Hirst Carpets, 50OZ 100%nylon carpet- comfort meets quality\r\n*Vitex Weather-Resistant Decking\r\n*Clever built-in shoe cabinet under the stairs for extra storage\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence: Zoned for Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay School & Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate, and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nLive the Rothesay Bay dream in this stunning new home - freehold title, high-end finishes, and a sun-filled layout just minutes from golden sands, cafés, and top schools. Titles issued, CCC granted - move in today!\r\nContact with us.",
